## Interface: 16001
## Title: Better Tracking
## Notes: Swaps herb and ore tracking as you move and pings when a node, rare or GatherMate2 spot shows up.
## Author: miyanko
## Version: 1.0.0
## Category: Map
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Ability_Tracking
## OptionalDeps: GatherMate2
## SavedVariables: BetterTrackingDB

# Load order is the dependency order: the libraries build the launcher, Config owns the saved settings, Alert
# owns the one alert output and the zoning handler both sources share, Probe and Geometry read the minimap,
# Memory is the node memory both sources share, Scanner is the minimap blip source, GatherMate is the optional
# GatherMate2 source, Swap alternates herb and ore tracking, and the UI files build on all of them.

Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
Libs\CallbackHandler-1.0\CallbackHandler-1.0.lua
Libs\LibDataBroker-1.1\LibDataBroker-1.1.lua
Libs\LibDBIcon-1.0\LibDBIcon-1.0.lua
Libs\LibNativeUI-1.0\LibNativeUI-1.0.lua

Core\Config.lua
Core\Alert.lua
Core\Probe.lua
Core\Geometry.lua
Core\Memory.lua
Core\Scanner.lua
Core\GatherMate.lua
Core\Swap.lua
UI\Options.lua
UI\Launcher.lua
